OL,3,AIran waiting for official US response
OL,4,Aafter Trump rejects Hormuz deal,
OL,5,Aminister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS negotiators have not officially
OL,8,Fresponded to Iran's proposal to reopen
OL,9,Fthe Strait of Hormuz, the country's
OL,10,Fforeign minister said, despite
OL,11,FPresident Donald Trump publicly
OL,12,Frejecting the offer on Saturday.
OL,14,FTrump told reporters at the White House
OL,15,Fthat Iran's proposal was not
OL,16,F"acceptable" and that Tehran wanted to
OL,17,Fmake a deal to open the strait to
OL,18,Fcommercial shipping within seven days
OL,19,Fbecause "they're losing so badly".
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
