OL,3,AIran waiting for official US response
OL,4,Aafter Trump rejects Hormuz deal,
OL,5,Aminister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a post on Telegram, Iranian Foreign
OL,8,FMinister Abbas Araghchi acknowledged
OL,9,FTrump's rejection, but said the
OL,10,Fpresident had made contradictory
OL,11,Fstatements in the past.
OL,13,FHe said Iran's negotiators were waiting
OL,14,Ffor a "definitive" response, and that
OL,15,Fonly a "negotiated solution" could end
OL,16,Fthe conflict.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
